{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History awaits your command!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSamurai Conqueror\u201d</strong> is an epic historical simulation and strategy game where you strive to unify Japanese history, spanning from the Kofun period to the Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a legendary leader to command your faction, expand your influence across eras, and bring the entirety of Japanese history under your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive and rewrite history through decisive events such as the <i>Taika Reform</i>, the <i>Genpei War</i>, the <i>\u014cnin War</i>, the <i>Battle of Sekigahara</i>, and the <i>Meiji Restoration</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lead a Legend</strong> \u2013 Choose one historical figure from Japanese history to guide your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Build Your Power</strong> \u2013 Strengthen commerce, farming, culture, and military through strategic development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rewrite History</strong> \u2013 Invade rival factions and expand your realm in the struggle to unify Japan across time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1757722548","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1757722548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/692a20b55832be984351c1f5b4861f46a6b56299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757722548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/692a20b55832be984351c1f5b4861f46a6b56299/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757722548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Fa